{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"31014","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:31014","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_123637","characterName":"Twins","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"123637","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"302916"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Twins","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/5234fe335f74a9bf0e0603fbba2c0b1447b51f23403bbda12acefa644c7951ef.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/4834662ea9b753126af38fa910c8645994f006d3ef7d6fc9f428c5521346b37a.webp","width":140,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"石川由依","creatorId":"vndb:s7547","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7547","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7547","name":"石川 由依","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:302916:123637:5727:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"花江夏樹","creatorId":"vndb:s2180","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2180","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2180","name":"ペロペロンチーノ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:302916:123637:7772:2","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_22527","characterName":"Nier","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22527","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"302916"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Nier","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。娘/妹のヨナと二人で暮らしている。純粋で正義感が強く、仲間思い。唯一の肉親であるヨナを非常に大切にしている。ヨナの黒文病を治すため、シロと共に各地を奔走、マモノとの戦いへと身を投じていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『レプリカント』では兄として登場。幼少期には貧しいながら笑顔を絶やさない、元気な少年として描かれているが、5年後の青年期ではどこか影を感じさせる青年へと成長。笑顔を見せる事が無くなっている。幼少期に比べ、言動に若干乱暴な部分が出てくるようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『ゲシュタルト』では、妻に先立たれてから男手一つでヨナを育てた父親として登場。愛娘の為に日々奮闘し、その溺愛っぷりは時折過保護とも受け取れる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22527"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/69/69ccc0956eab7c829646f4214f9d7acf5baf1d5ed1fe7e28efe0a83140c7f241.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b304e90afa1d9aedc011ac0e00561cace7ef819b25b87c1af742f8ca7fb342dc.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"遊佐浩二","creatorId":"vndb:s56","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s56","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s56","name":"遊佐 浩二","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:302916:22527:4614:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"岡本信彦","creatorId":"vndb:s550","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s550","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s550","name":"岡本 信彦","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:302916:22527:4950:2","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_24055","characterName":"凯恩","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"24055","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"302916"}]},"originalCharacterName":"凯恩","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"172"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"二刀流の女戦士。その可憐な見た目に反して祖母譲りの豪快さ・言動の荒さが特徴的である。 数年前まで祖母と二人暮らししていたが、巨大なマモノ「フック」に襲われ祖母は死亡。カイネも瀕死の重傷を負うが、その際に半身にマモノ・テュランが取り憑き、「マモノ憑き」となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両性具有であることを理由に酷い虐めを受けていた過去の反動と、半身のマモノの浸食を防ぐ為に大胆な下着姿をしており、白の書からは「下着女」と呼ばれ、事あるごとに口喧嘩をしている。半身に包帯を巻いているのは、テュランに対するカイネなりの配慮である（ゲシュタルトは日光を浴びると消滅する）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"マモノへの憎悪のみが生きる理由となっていたが、祖母の仇のマモノをニーアが撃破し、復讐が終わったことで生きる理由を失う。その後はニーアのために剣を振るうようになり、行動を共にするうちにニーアへの思いを募らせるようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テュランの影響で彼女のみマモノの声を聞くことができ、二周目以降だとマモノの台詞に字幕があてられる。これにより発生するイベントは極めて悲哀を誘う内容である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに、両性具有であるのは長年に渡るレプリカントシステムのエラーによるもので、カイネのゲシュタルトは婚約者のいる普通の女性である。ドラマCDではそれに加え、上流階級のお嬢様であることの他、レプリカントのカイネにも関わる特殊な出生の秘密も明かされた。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"24055"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b83ffa440670f5f51688a6389bea0512bee93b11dc05db6d2698bfe012697a40.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/da7faa66da9d47e26ce0055184a1d27da411e5b316ccf841a64e2baa49929450.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田中敦子","creatorId":"vndb:s78","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s78","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s78","name":"田中 敦子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:302916:24055:3873:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_24056","characterName":"Grimoire Weiss","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"24056","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"302916"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Grimoire Weiss","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"石の神殿でニーアと出会う、人語を話す「封印の書物」。ゲシュタルト版での名称はGrimoire　Weiss(グリモア・ヴァイス)。博識で尊大だが、時々ボケたりするなど憎めない性格の持ち主。ニーアや他の仲間からは「シロ」と呼ばれている。当初はこの呼び方に文句を言っていたが、最後に嫌いではなかったと語っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ニーアとの出会いの際ほとんどの記憶を失い、自身が何者であるのか忘れてしまっている。口が達者かつ毒舌でカイネとは些細な言い争いが耐えず、自ら「口が最大の武器」と自負している。封印されし言葉を得ることで魔法を使えるようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゲーム中における記録やステータスの閲覧は、この白の書を見るという形態になっている。そのため、白の書が存在しないとそれらのデータは閲覧不可能である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"設定資料集内のSSでは、誕生の秘密らしき内容が描かれている。本来白の書は封印されし言葉を集め、「黒の書」と融合することで全てのゲシュタルト体を強制的に肉体に戻すようプログラムされていたのだが、ニーアが白の書を無理やり叩き起こしたことで白の書は記憶を失ってレプリカント体の側に付き、黒の書を拒絶した。最後には魔王を倒すために消滅するが、設定資料集のSSを見るとその意識は完全に消滅したわけではない模様。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"24056"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9d20a058383124ca533b5cd5263b3ae6876b0c29a8d434287d0ac5977ac262a2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9ef6cf97fe0d3937c2501ee95da616b256b37d03d7c9e3b666c9a92228589c4e.webp","width":191,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"安元洋貴","creatorId":"vndb:s377","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s377","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s377","name":"安元 洋貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:302916:24056:4483:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_50789","characterName":"约娜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"50789","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"302916"}]},"originalCharacterName":"约娜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ニーアの娘（ゲシュタルト）、または妹（レプリカント）。ニーアを気遣い、とても大切に思っているが、過度に依存している。生まれつき病弱であったが、更に謎の奇病「黒文病」を患ってしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50789"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a5408698546c8b8c5d5d24f397c40696c71f23dda2dc10d285b0d9154dc51fad.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a98f88e8c3f60aef13a45f473413903de3b6760e03a03841c136fe9fe9fee99.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野中藍","creatorId":"vndb:s1187","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1187","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1187","name":"野中 藍","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:302916:50789:4371:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_50977","characterName":"Grimoire Noir","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"50977","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"302916"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Grimoire Noir","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"白の書と対となる存在。ゲシュタルト版での名称はGrimoire　Noir(グリモア・ノアール)。古の歌に病を振り撒くものとしてその存在が歌われるものの、所在は不明。ヨナを救う為、ニーアが探している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"作中最初期に登場する黒の書は複製品であり、触れたものをゲシュタルト体へ変換する機能を持つ。現在は魔王と契約しており、ニーアが使う魔法と同等かそれ以上の魔法を駆使する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自信過剰で傲慢であり、白の書を格下扱いしている。実際に白の書の封印された言葉を奪い取るなどの機能がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔王に対しては忠実な臣下であり、ドラマCDではゲームでは見られなかった一面も描かれている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50977"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d3e1ad193eeb1c76b206c3b0e621f8fd7c663687dfd0afda3d471fbb5f1ad418.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/67e10e8e30f4708ee59f71f874f814a06cdc5528c26eecaa646d7dc72122769d.webp","width":203,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"立木文彦","creatorId":"vndb:s1943","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1943","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1943","name":"立木 文彦","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:302916:50977:4112:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_51777","characterName":"迪波尔","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"51777","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"137588"},{"characterId":"51777","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"302916"}]},"originalCharacterName":"迪波尔","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"79"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"56"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"159.6"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"2人組の旧型アンドロイドで、レジスタンスのキャンプに住んでいる。2人とも赤毛に白の花飾りを付けているのが特徴で、アンドロイドながら珍しく飲酒が可能。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"過去に自分達の同型機が暴走した事を知っており、それについて申し訳なく思っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"51777"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9b87abe36aac36eb25a616f2458c03d13e9bdb5ebe51ce2baf054407dfc2c5f5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4e66a7c5616d32d1b33b6294636bc1a356afa9fefb8e0a2bbe9101111a53f96c.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"白石涼子","creatorId":"vndb:s953","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s953","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s953","name":"白石涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:302916:51777:4730:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_57636","characterName":"Emil","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"57636","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"137588"},{"characterId":"57636","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"302916"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Emil","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭蓋骨のような球体状の頭部を持つ謎の生命体。『ニーア ゲシュタルト/レプリカント』に登場した少年「エミール(実験兵器7号)」がエイリアンに対抗するために生み出した自己増殖体の一つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時間の経過と自己複製の際の自我の薄まりにより記憶の多くを失っている。頭部のみの状態でも長時間の活動が可能であり、現在の体はスクーターに有り合わせのパーツを付けたもので構成されている。なおその形態を活かして行商も行っているが、呼び込みの際に掛けている大音響の歌が騒音であるとしてレジスタンスキャンプでは苦情が挙げられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他のキャラクターとは違いビジュアルの全体像は公表されておらず、公式サイトでもモザイクがかけられている状態での掲載となっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"57636"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2b/2ba657129779363cf7407f16637f4ea2f1f126cf7a475faca882b7060c5d00dd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6f/6fa40ff0f62faa911d00fef710de8708d032794160c3866d461e4682cc021d91.webp","width":256,"height":250,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"門脇舞以","creatorId":"vndb:s440","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s440","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s440","name":"門脇 舞以","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:302916:57636:4402:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_77117","characterName":"波波尔","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"77117","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"137588"},{"characterId":"77117","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"302916"}]},"originalCharacterName":"波波尔","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"81"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"54"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"163.2"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"2人組の旧型アンドロイドで、レジスタンスのキャンプに住んでいる。2人とも赤毛に白の花飾りを付けているのが特徴で、アンドロイドながら珍しく飲酒が可能。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"過去に自分達の同型機が暴走した事を知っており、それについて申し訳なく思っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77117"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/ad4a2d0627c9bc18bd1531a77f056fb3b38be7572c4092014be6c63f0ce7ec7f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/13b7d0d1d7108130441103b559a2b959255a5c64d155203026abf864a4477f88.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"白石涼子","creatorId":"vndb:s953","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s953","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s953","name":"白石涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:302916:77117:4730:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_95892","characterName":"King of Facade","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"95892","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"302916"}]},"originalCharacterName":"King of Facade","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"掟を尊ぶ「仮面の街」を統べる若き王。水不足やマモノの脅威に心を痛める、誰よりも民を想う心優しい王である。ただし、民にとって最も大事な掟を破る回数は、誰よりも多いようだ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"95892"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/ae6d2c7b97e33b3c63074310032a710ca317536a23b972bfff78d7f437df239d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/64c1f4b798ec3512c5dfa57a98545b60268f8992c4e4e72a470ff1ee7b551116.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎木淳弥","creatorId":"vndb:s2175","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2175","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2175","name":"榎木 淳弥","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:302916:95892:16353:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_95893","characterName":"Fyra","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"95893","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"302916"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Fyra","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"掟を尊ぶ「仮面の街」の少女。幼いころに奉公として仮面の街に出されたらしく、掟によって言葉を話すことが禁じられている。誰にでも優しく大人しいが、芯の強さもあわせ持つ。カイネに助けてもらったことと元々の優しさから、街で戸惑う主人公たちに親切に接してくれる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"95893"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/78f507ec8794ae723647705a09c02dfc63f25ca79935af848ae86a52355c7661.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/4669acc897fa9703ab2612e81aa346a8d37ddba7fb005608d5c328b28144c2f7.webp","width":214,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_95894","characterName":"Louise","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"95894","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"302916"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Louise","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"漂着した難破船で発見された少女。漂流中に何かあったのか、上手く言葉を話すことができない。海岸の街の郵便配達員には心を開いている様子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"95894"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b7020c33989c2bcbccf4a8a6f98439727577409888074ca67483c9ab01693623.webp","fallbackU